    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a remote village shrouded in mysteries. You are a brave hero on a mission to find your missing uncle, who vanished deep within ancient caves. But something strange awaits you inside \u2014 after a collapse, a new passage reveals technologies that seem otherworldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underground labyrinths, solve intricate puzzles, and forge your path using cubes, floating platforms, bridges, cylinders, and pressure plates. These puzzles are the only key to moving forward, and each solved mystery brings you closer to uncovering your uncle's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an exciting journey where the atmosphere of a remote village and mysterious caves intertwines with technology beyond ordinary understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric environment inspired by a secluded village and mysterious caves<br>\u2022 Unique puzzle mechanics: cubes, platforms, bridges, doors, and more<br>\u2022 Detailed locations, from the quiet village to ancient caves<br>\u2022 Puzzles that require logical thinking and attentiveness<br>\u2022 A gradually unfolding story revealing secrets of the past</p>",
